# Scacelith - Ελληνικά (Greek)
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same {n}). Plurals: one|other.
# Register: the polite plural "εσείς" of Greek software ("Επιλέξτε", "Πατήστε"); buttons and menu
# entries are nouns ("Αποθήκευση", "Νέα παρτίδα"). The player's gender is unknown: no adjective or
# participle that agrees with the player, and no article or genitive before a player's name {0}
# (verbs carry no gender: "{0} κερδίζει", "{0}: ο χρόνος τελείωσε"). The sides: "τα λευκά / τα μαύρα",
# the players "τα Λευκά / τα Μαύρα" (plural verb). Titles in capitals drop the tonos and keep the
# dialytika (ΡΟΛΟΪ). Question mark ";", ano teleia "·", quotes « ». Chess words of the Greek federation.
# Keep the sections: other parts of the game add their keys in sections of their own.

